    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Travel made easy\nWhen thinking of air travel remember there\nis a Qantas Travel agent nearby. You will find\nhe has up-to-the-minute information, specialized\nknowledge and experience\nand\ncan offer\nan all - round service that saves you money.\nAMERICAN AND CANADIAN OFFICES\nBOSTON: B.O.A.C. Hotel Statler, 22 Providence St\nBoston\n16,\nMassachusetts.\n*Phone: Hancock 6-1341/3 \u0026 6-1318.\nCHICAGO:\nIllinois.\nThe Mallers B 3022 DALLAS.\nChicago\n3,\n'Phone: Andover\n69 East Madison St. E12 Cotton\nBook\n'Phone:\n4803.\nDetroit 26,\nMichigan.\nHONOLULU: T. H. Davies \u0026 Co. Ltd., Davies' Bidg.\nPhone 56991.\nANGELES: QANTAS\nPhone:\n5-1341.\nMIAMI:\nB.O.A.C. Columbus\n506 West Sixth St. Phone: Mst\nMadison\nHotel,\nMONTREAL:\nLaurentien\nMontreal 2,\n'Phone: University\nMOKe A MY 3670 FRAMONTO 60 A\n342 Madison Ave.,\nOffice). 'Phone:\n212 Stockton St.\nTORONTO: B.O.A.C.\n32 King\nOntario.\n32 KOU SER CANTS Hotel arcover.\n'Phone: Empire 3-4323\nPhone: Tatlow\n8231.\nWASHINGTON: B.O.A.C., 1124 Connecticut Ave., N.W. Washing-\nton\n6.\n'Phone: Executive 3-3944.\nQANTAS EMPIRE AIRWAYS LTD.\n(INCORPORATED IN QUEENSLAND)\nAUSTRALIA'S OVERSEAS AIRLINE\nIN ASSOCIATION WITH TEAL\nBook through\nPRINTED IN\nAUSTRALIA\nGeneral Agents:\nBritish Overseas Airways Corporation\nOffices in New York \u0026 Chicago 2014.110.54\nN.S.P. ATT. 2/55",
